      "content": "thanks. i've seen a lot of people online talking about how this is basically just a way for the government to restrict where people can go or trap them in certain zones. do you think those people are just falling for conspiracy theories, or is there any actual substance to the idea that it's about losing freedom of movement? maybe differentiate between the real stuff and the real political concerns if you can. bit",
